{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在進一步推動用户從經典版Outlook遷移至新版Outlook。最新跡象顯示，這家軟件巨頭不僅持續在Windows 11中推廣新版郵件客户端，如今甚至開始向部分用户提供Microsoft Rewards獎勵積分，以鼓勵他們親自體驗這一產品。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585430.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.668704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:27:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.969657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"4bedba4f3e81ec78c1dd11d397c333c9c50238647bdb5b63eb8ab8788319f1f1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}